WEBVTT

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:32.660
<i>This is...</i>

00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:36.820
<i>Alone?</i>

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:43.540
<i>Are you crying?</i>

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.660
Where are you going?

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:52.170
What are you holding?

00:02:05.870 --> 00:02:06.890
Tenma?

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:10.640
Wait...

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:15.570
Wait!

00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:25.910
Lady Athena, I have a message.

00:02:25.910 --> 00:02:29.620
We, Aries Shion and Libra Dohko,

00:02:29.620 --> 00:02:32.250
have just returned from Italy.

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:37.260
We regret to inform you that we were defeated.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:40.980
Three Silver Saints and one Bronze are injured.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:44.260
And two Bronzes are likely dead.

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:48.730
The town near the forest cathedral
has been annihilated,

00:02:48.730 --> 00:02:52.110
and the area around the cathedral
has become Hades's border.

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:53.770
And...

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:58.340
The man chosen as the
reincarnation of Hades is named Alone.

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.530
What are the names of the dead Bronze Saints?

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:08.620
Right.

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:13.130
Unicorn Yato and Pegasus Tenma.

00:03:15.490 --> 00:03:18.130
I see...

00:03:22.570 --> 00:03:24.190
I understand.

00:03:24.190 --> 00:03:27.700
The Specters should be advancing
here immediately.

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:31.850
Heighten Sanctuary security according to the Pope's instructions

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:33.650
and prepare to intercept them.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:37.520
And Dohko, Shion...

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:39.280
Y-Yes!

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.530
Thank you for your hard work.

00:03:43.470 --> 00:03:45.580
Please rest with the other
Silver and Bronze Saints,

00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:49.080
in preparation for the coming battle.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.790
Thank you for your kind words.

00:03:52.600 --> 00:03:55.790
<i>Athena... How brave...</i>

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:59.280
<i>She must be feeling so sad.</i>

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:01.760
<i>Athena...</i>

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:18.900
You idiot, Tenma.

00:04:21.700 --> 00:04:23.240
I really

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:26.200
hated you, but...

00:04:26.850 --> 00:04:27.930
If...

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:29.200
you die,

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:32.700
Lady Athena will...

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:36.320
You know she'll cry!

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:44.930
You idiot!

00:04:44.930 --> 00:04:48.900
Oh, so there were survivors?

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.640
A Specter?

00:04:55.640 --> 00:04:57.230
Take this!

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:09.740
<i>A woman?</i>

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:14.620
Idiot, conceal your Cosmo.
The Specters will see you.

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:16.370
What?

00:05:17.300 --> 00:05:19.840
I have been instructed by my master

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.980
to collect the Pegasus Saint.

00:05:21.980 --> 00:05:23.860
Huh? What are you...

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:25.630
He's dead.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:29.180
I can't trust you, anyway...

00:05:29.180 --> 00:05:30.140
What are you?

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:34.060
I am a Jamir warrior, Yuzuriha.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:37.640
Listen, that Pegasus Saint is not completely dead.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:38.710
What?

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:42.770
He's...

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:43.870
alive?

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:45.650
So says my master.

00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.300
Carry him, and follow me.

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:53.420
Ready?

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.660
What is this?

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.800
We're here.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.480
Huh... No way.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.530
What?

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:15.340
Wh-What is this place?

00:06:16.220 --> 00:06:18.370
This is Jamir.

00:06:18.370 --> 00:06:19.220
Let's go.

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:41.250
My master is waiting here. Enter.

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.590
What's wrong?

00:06:51.700 --> 00:06:52.760
All right!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:56.340
<i>But can I</i>

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:57.850
<i>trust this woman?</i>

00:06:58.480 --> 00:07:01.020
<i>She's not even a Saint, and she's so strong...</i>

00:07:01.630 --> 00:07:05.430
<i>On top of that, she tells me Tenma isn't dead.</i>

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:08.960
<i>Can't let my guard down.</i>

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:24.790
Destroyed Cloths?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:29.300
You deceived me!

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:37.720
You're one of Hades's men.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:44.350
What have you done with the
men these Cloths belong to?

00:07:45.510 --> 00:07:47.520
Don't lose it, boy!

00:07:58.740 --> 00:07:59.830
Oh, dear.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:01.890
Listen carefully, boy!

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:07.210
We execute Athena's orders to
overthrow Hades in this land.

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:10.090
The battlegrounds may be far apart,
but we are comrades!

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:15.090
He is the Master. Try not to be disrespectful.

00:08:15.660 --> 00:08:19.600
What do you mean, comrades?
You think I believe that?

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.060
Then...

00:08:21.690 --> 00:08:24.440
How do you explain all these Cloths here?

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.940
Huh?

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:27.560
I see.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:28.940
Then...

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:30.530
What?

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:41.000
Wha...

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.000
What are you doing?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.020
Give it back!

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:43.870
Yuzuriha!

00:08:44.350 --> 00:08:45.770
Then we're okay?

00:08:45.770 --> 00:08:46.570
Yes.

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:54.250
Wh-What are you doing?

00:08:55.870 --> 00:08:58.010
This Cloth has already perished.

00:08:59.090 --> 00:09:01.920
Do you know that it requires a vast amount

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:05.690
of Saint's blood to revive a dead Cloth?

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:16.090
But as the war has already begun,
that need cannot be met.

00:09:17.550 --> 00:09:20.940
Yuzuriha has not been trained as a Saint,

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:22.660
but I have trained her as a warrior.

00:09:23.280 --> 00:09:26.770
The Cosmo that lies within her
can defeat any Silver Saint.

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:31.960
H-Hey.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.430
I mean come on, old man!

00:09:33.430 --> 00:09:34.850
She's just a girl.

00:09:36.020 --> 00:09:37.340
That's right, boy.

00:09:39.460 --> 00:09:42.600
We are also putting our lives
on the line for this fight.

00:09:45.960 --> 00:09:50.340
This land is Jamir,
where Cloths die and are revived.

00:09:50.340 --> 00:09:52.980
I'll revive your broken

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:55.430
and dead Cloth.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:13.000
The rebirth of the Unicorn Cloth!

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:17.110
Wow... How light.

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:20.630
Strength is filling my injured body...

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:24.830
Yuzuriha, you've come to!

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:28.020
Are you all right? You scared me.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:29.730
I'm fine. Don't worry.

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:34.230
More importantly, we still have work to do.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:38.990
As I thought.

00:10:38.990 --> 00:10:40.430
So he isn't dead?

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:43.280
No, I already looked and checked.

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.370
Look at the flower wreath on his right arm.

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:49.370
It's as full of life as if it were
made a mere moment ago.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:54.420
It must have been made by Lady Athena as a child.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:57.060
I sense a strong blessing Cosmo for the Pegasus Saint

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:59.340
that she subconsciously filled it with.

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:04.480
That wreath protects his soul.

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:07.390
It's the only thing keeping
his soul tied to his body.

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:12.330
Right now, he must be wandering aimlessly through the Underworld.

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.350
The Underworld...

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:18.190
But not for long.

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:19.350
Look.

00:11:23.000 --> 00:11:24.240
The petals are...

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:25.810
No...

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:29.360
When all the petals are gone,

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:32.750
the Pegasus Saint's soul will fall
completely into the Underworld.

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:37.460
What can I do?

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:43.720
I'd give my life to keep Lady Athena

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.720
from heartbreak!

00:11:48.490 --> 00:11:50.510
You'd put your life on the line?

00:11:50.510 --> 00:11:53.020
Yes! Anything for Lady Athena!

00:11:53.710 --> 00:11:55.980
Well said, Unicorn Saint.

00:11:56.990 --> 00:11:58.860
The only way to save a man in the Underworld

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:01.490
is to travel there and bring him back!

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.780
You'll have to die!

00:12:08.550 --> 00:12:10.660
Unicorn Saint!

00:12:16.710 --> 00:12:18.980
What?

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:19.800
Ready?

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.020
Best take this sword with you.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.140
It will protect you.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:35.400
<i>Just give it to me normally...</i>

00:12:37.170 --> 00:12:38.730
Listen, Unicorn Saint.

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:42.280
The living cannot enter the Underworld.

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:44.400
That's the reason for this sword.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:50.470
This sword is filled with Lady Athena's blood and

00:12:50.470 --> 00:12:52.160
prayers from the previous Holy War.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:53.560
It is a holy sword.

00:12:54.220 --> 00:13:00.040
For a short time, it will protect you,
as the Pegasus Saint's wreath does him.

00:13:00.830 --> 00:13:03.050
<i>Lady Athena's prayers...</i>

00:13:04.000 --> 00:13:05.300
Are you ready?

00:13:08.470 --> 00:13:10.350
Anything for Lady Athena!

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:14.680
Well said.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:20.230
<i>Praesepe Underworld Wave!</i>

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:32.040
I-I can't move my body...

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:36.320
The Praesepe are the blue stars connecting
this world and the next.

00:13:37.020 --> 00:13:39.240
That is the hole through which the dead pass.

00:13:39.240 --> 00:13:42.000
My Praesepe Underworld Wave

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:45.210
is a secret path to the hole
that the living may go through.

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:49.290
Burn your Cosmo, Unicorn Saint,

00:13:49.290 --> 00:13:51.300
as strongly as you can!

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:53.470
As strongly as you can!

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:09.410
That was a little too forced, stupid old man.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:16.910
This is the Underworld...

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:24.420
What?

00:14:27.180 --> 00:14:28.560
Yuzuriha!

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.820
Why are you here?

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:34.930
The Master told me to lend you a hand.

00:14:34.930 --> 00:14:38.760
So he doesn't trust me?

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:41.560
You can't be too careful.

00:14:42.340 --> 00:14:45.190
If something happens to you, I'll protect you.

00:14:45.190 --> 00:14:46.570
I promise.

00:14:47.830 --> 00:14:51.950
Wh-Whatever! I'm the man,
so that's my line!

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:55.330
Anyway, we should hurry.

00:14:55.330 --> 00:14:57.830
We must find the Pegasus Saint
as soon as possible,

00:14:58.430 --> 00:15:01.640
or he'll be completely dead, just like they are.

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:05.990
You're right.

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:11.900
They're all walking in the same direction.

00:15:11.900 --> 00:15:15.350
They're headed for the entrance
to the land of the dead.

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.530
The path to the netherworld...

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:27.690
Those who fall into that hole
can never be revived.

00:15:28.090 --> 00:15:30.140
For all eternity...

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:32.450
To suffer in the netherworld...

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:37.710
They must be the townspeople that were killed by Hades.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:39.700
From Tenma's hometown...

00:15:40.630 --> 00:15:41.960
Let's look ahead.

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:46.470
You idiot, Tenma!

00:15:59.570 --> 00:16:01.450
Wh-What is this?

00:16:01.450 --> 00:16:03.190
What's holding me down?

00:16:04.680 --> 00:16:06.820
Crap!

00:16:06.820 --> 00:16:09.120
You're finally awake.

00:16:09.940 --> 00:16:11.570
Who's there?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:16.200
I am the Heavenly Wounded Star, Mandrake.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.450
Fyodor.

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.740
You're the Pegasus Saint, aren't you?

00:16:21.740 --> 00:16:22.830
Where am I?

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:25.460
The space between the land of the living
and the Underworld.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:26.710
The Underworld?

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:30.910
<i>Then I was killed?</i>

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.940
I don't know how you can move around

00:16:34.940 --> 00:16:36.930
when you're supposed to be dead, but...

00:16:36.930 --> 00:16:40.290
I'm sure it's because the
ever-merciful soul of Lord Hades

00:16:40.290 --> 00:16:43.180
took pity on you at the last moment.

00:16:43.770 --> 00:16:46.190
Specter, don't you call Alone...

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:51.860
Merciful!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:00.160
<i>Wh-What?</i>

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:03.680
What?

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:10.250
I'll tell you something good before
you fall into the netherworld.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:14.360
One of the three Underworld leaders, Minos,

00:17:14.360 --> 00:17:17.510
leads his army for the Sanctuary right now.

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:19.650
What did you say?

00:17:19.650 --> 00:17:26.020
The merciful Lord Hades will send all your
friends into the Underworld.

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:29.110
Look forward to that.

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:35.750
No!

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:38.530
There he is.

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:43.910
He's supposed to be dead. Why is he so jumpy?

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.830
Maybe he's stupid?

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:50.490
Who cares. Release him before the enemy returns.

00:17:50.490 --> 00:17:51.170
Yeah!

00:17:55.980 --> 00:17:56.970
We've been found!

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:03.420
Yato, what are you doing here?

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:06.180
Oh, so you're dead, too.

00:18:07.750 --> 00:18:09.440
Shut up!

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:10.560
I am not!

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.200
You're a slippery one!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:29.200
Who is she? A Saint?

00:18:29.200 --> 00:18:31.290
No.

00:18:33.310 --> 00:18:37.650
Looks like we've got some rats
at the gates to the netherworld.

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.930
No problem.

00:18:42.670 --> 00:18:44.180
You're all sentenced to death.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:45.180
Yuzuriha!

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:47.680
Tear apart...

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:50.330
From ears to brain!

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:53.940
<i>Strangle Shrill!</i>

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:07.080
I told you... Men protect women.

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:13.460
Guts!

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.560
<i>That idiot!</i>

00:19:19.560 --> 00:19:22.340
Hey! Watch out for his shock wave!

00:19:22.340 --> 00:19:24.450
It'll numb your senses!

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:25.850
Too late, idiot.

00:19:25.850 --> 00:19:28.450
That's right, rats.

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:31.850
The shock waves emitted by this armor

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:34.370
aren't just any shock waves.

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:40.240
The mandrake root said to grow
beneath the gallows...

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:48.120
They say that all who hear it scream,
as it's uprooted, perish.

00:19:48.120 --> 00:19:49.540
Like this...

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.130
Yuzuriha.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.230
You bastard!

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:05.760
How dare you hurt a girl?

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:13.500
Idiot... Your numb fist is no match for me.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.060
Yato!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:18.730
You have no business with Lord Hades.

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.190
I'll kill you here and now.

00:20:22.160 --> 00:20:24.530
Try it. Bastard.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:28.280
<i>Unicorn Gallop!</i>

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.250
You bastard!

00:20:42.030 --> 00:20:43.340
Yato!

00:20:45.860 --> 00:20:46.720
Move!

00:20:48.640 --> 00:20:50.350
Out of the way!

00:20:55.800 --> 00:20:57.580
Bastard...

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:01.010
Getting ahead of yourself!

00:21:01.710 --> 00:21:03.070
I'm your

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:04.740
next opponent!

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:09.120
What?

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:11.120
Where does that strength come from?

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:14.290
Your turn to scream!

00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:15.670
Mandrake!

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:20.660
<i>Pegasus Comet Fist!</i>

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:27.010
How can he get off hundreds of
simultaneous punches?

00:21:36.700 --> 00:21:38.270
Crap.

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:42.340
We came to rescue you,
but got ourselves in big trouble.

00:21:42.340 --> 00:21:44.940
So you mean I'm not really dead?

00:21:44.940 --> 00:21:47.240
Your bracelet!

00:21:47.660 --> 00:21:51.700
That bracelet carries
Lady Athena's prayers, apparently.

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:55.410
But when all the petals wither, you'll really be dead.

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:58.290
Is that so? That Sasha...

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:01.420
Sorry to disturb your rest,

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.090
but we don't have much time.

00:22:03.520 --> 00:22:05.920
Yeah! That bastard told me!

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:09.050
One of the three Specter leaders is heading

00:22:09.050 --> 00:22:10.680
for the Sanctuary with his troops!

00:22:10.680 --> 00:22:11.960
What?

00:22:11.960 --> 00:22:14.580
So hurry up and bring me back to life!

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:15.310
We can't.

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:17.120
Huh? Why not?

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:21.440
We must go deeper still into the
Underworld to do something.

00:22:22.120 --> 00:22:28.280
The Master tells me it is so important,
it will change this Holy War's direction.

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:33.280
How futile.

00:22:34.400 --> 00:22:35.850
The Sanctuary...

00:22:36.400 --> 00:22:42.040
And even Athena is but a puppet for us to manipulate.

00:24:03.010 --> 00:24:04.170
Lord Hades,

00:24:04.710 --> 00:24:09.590
I, one of the three strongest Specters,

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:11.420
will soon arrive at the Sanctuary.

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:18.010
The Saints will become mere puppets,
and I will hold their strings.

00:24:18.010 --> 00:24:20.270
How frail is life.

00:24:20.880 --> 00:24:23.970
What? Rose petals... Why?

00:24:24.690 --> 00:24:27.400
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:27.400 --> 00:24:28.880
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...

00:24:28.880 --> 00:24:30.240
The Poison Rose.
